<title>USA: Dillard Department Stores sets qtly div.</title>
<headline>Dillard Department Stores sets qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1996-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillard Department Stores Inc said it declared a class A quarterly dividend.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.04		     $0.04</p>
